  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1106.01 Final Application Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1106.01 Final Application Requirements. An applicant whose project is on the PPL who wishes to obtain funding shall submit to the department the following:\n\n(a) The information required for a final application specified in Env-Dw 1106.03 on or with “Form 1: Final Application”, NHDES-W-03-064, December 2020, available at https://onlineforms.nh.gov/?FormTag=NHDES-W-03-064;\n\n(b) Confirmation of the applicant’s authority to borrow as specified in Env-Dw 1106.04;\n\n(c) Information regarding the environmental review required by Env-Dw 1108, as specified in Env-Dw 1106.05;\n\n(d) A capacity assurance self-assessment as specified in Env-Dw 1106.06;\n\n(e) The bank information specified in Env-Dw 1106.07;\n\n(f) A planning document as specified in Env-Dw 1106.08; and\n\n(g) Verification of a revenue program as specified in Env-Dw 1106.09.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1100.html"
